# Solidity on Monad

Before writing or deploying contracts, read `.cursor/skills/monskill/SKILL.md`, then `gas` and `addresses`.

- `foundry.toml` must set `network = "monad"`. Foundry must be v1.8 or newer.
- Monad charges gas limit, not gas used. Set the limit explicitly when it is known.
- Do not paste an address into source until the `addresses` skill and `eth_getCode` on chain id 10143 both agree it has code.
